     <P><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA" lang=EN-US><FONT size=3 face=宋体><STRONG>有兴趣的同学可自行报名参加。</STRONG><BR style="PAGE-BREAK-BEFORE: always; mso-break-type: section-break" clear=all></P>
<DIV style="LAYOUT-GRID:  15.6pt none" class=Section1>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体">天津大学<SPAN lang=EN-US>2017</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>工程科学<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>冬令营招生简章<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face="Times New Roman"> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; TEXT-INDENT: 35.45pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">天津大学精密仪器与光电子工程学院（简称精仪学院），是全国</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">17</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">所试点改革学院之一。为充分发挥高校社会服务和创新人才培养的功能，自</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">2012</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年开始在全国中学范围内开展</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">工程科学</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">夏令营和冬令营活动。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; TEXT-INDENT: 35.45pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">天津大学将于</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">2017</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年举办</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">工程科学</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">冬令营活动，旨在培养广大中学生对工程科学的兴趣，增进中学生对天津大学和精仪学院各工程学科的了解，引导和激励广大中学生走近科技、了解科技、参与科技，不断强化意识，拓宽思维，开拓视野，提高科技创新和实践能力。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; TEXT-INDENT: 35.45pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">本次</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">工程科学</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">冬令营为第五届，主题为</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">“</FONT></SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">邂逅工程科学</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">·</FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">颠覆未来世界</SPAN></B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">，旨在通过天津大学精仪学院的工程学科专业特色优势，启迪青少年的科技创新意识，激发青少年的科技创新兴趣，让青少年能够在这里体验工程科学的魅力，感悟工程科学的真谛。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; TEXT-INDENT: 35.45pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-margin-top-alt: auto" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">一、招生对象</SPAN></B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">综合素质优秀、特长突出、品学兼优、热爱工程科学、有志于报考天津大学精仪学院各专业</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">(</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">测控技术与仪器、光电信息科学与工程、电子科学与技术、生物医学工程</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">)</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">的高中理科学生。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.65pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">二、报名方法 </SPAN></B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; TEXT-INDENT: 35.45pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">登录天津大学精仪学院网站</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><A href="http://jyxy.tju.edu.cn/cn/"><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; TEXT-DECORATION: none; text-underline: none"><FONT face="Times New Roman">http://jyxy.tju.edu.cn/cn/</FONT></SPAN></A></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">下载推荐报名表，</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">以电子邮件形式发送以下材料：①个人自述（个人简介、对工程科学的认识、对未来的规划等）；②天津大学</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">2017</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年“工程科学”冬令营报名表（网上下载）；③获奖证书扫描件（如有）④近期</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">寸照片电子版。以上材料请以压缩包的形式加载附件发送至</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">jingyicamp@126.com</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">，邮件名形式为“</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">2017</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">冬令营报名</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">-</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">籍贯</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">-</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">学校</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">-</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">姓名”。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
