<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; TEXT-INDENT: 35.45pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">根据学生申请材料，由精仪学院组织专家委员会进行审核，合格者获得营员资格。精仪学院将于报名截止后一周内网上公示，同时以电子邮件或电话方式联系本人确认。经专家组评审考察，向冬令营优秀营员颁发结业证书。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 125%; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
